"Bipède biomécanique brun à dôme verdâtre lisse, projection tubulaire devant la bouche, tubes dorsaux et longue queue recourbée.": "Brown biomechanical biped with a smooth greenish dome, tubular projection in front of the mouth, dorsal tubes and long curved tail.",
