"M12 sur vue primaire Art Bully : tube, poignée supérieure, carter ajouré et tambour arrière conservés. Modèle distinct des M5 et M6B ; adaptation fixe non certifiée 1:1, sans nouvelle animation.": "M12 from the Art Bully primary view: tube, top handle, perforated housing and rear drum kept. Model distinct from the M5 and M6B; fixed adaptation not certified 1:1, no new animation.",
